    Pink, as the Society files them: household service, and legally property.

    The reference is explicit that Pinks are bought rather than employed, and
    RimWorld already models exactly that through Ideology's slavery, so nothing
    needed inventing and nothing needed depicting. What the Gardens actually train
    is emotional read - body language, empathy, detecting a lie - which is why the
    Solar Republic later used Pinks as field lie-detectors. That reads as Social,
